### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Get movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Movie that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### Create a new movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982
}

### Get all movies again (check that Blade Runner is there)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### Update a movie
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### Check that the movie was updated
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Check that the movie was deleted (should be 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Check all movies after delete
GET http://localhost:3000/movies